{"type":"user","message":{"role":"user","content":[{"tool_use_id":"toolu_01YWMqCBD61dhDJb2PHPrJS5","type":"tool_result","content":"Web search results for query: \"Nobel Prize in Literature 2026 winner\"\n\nLinks: [{\"title\":\"Canadian poet, writer Anne Carson wins 2026 Nobel Prize in Literature\",\"url\":\"https://www.khaleejtimes.com/world/anne-carson-canadian-poet-writer-2026-nobel-prize-literature\"},{\"title\":\"Anne Carson: The 2026 Nobel Prize in Literature Winner\",\"url\":\"https://bookshop.org/lists/anne-carson-the-2026-nobel-prize-in-literature-winner\"},{\"title\":\"Nobel Prize in Literature 2026\",\"url\":\"https://nobelprize.org/prizes/literature/2026/summary\"},{\"title\":\"blue News Logo\",\"url\":\"https://www.bluewin.ch/en/lifestyle/nobel-prize-in-literature-awarded-to-canadian-anne-carson-li.3628676\"},{\"title\":\"Nobel Prize in Literature 2026\",\"url\":\"https://www.nobelprize.org/prizes/literature/2026/\"},{\"title\":\"anne carson canadian poet writer 2026 nobel prize literature\",\"url\":\"https://www.khaleejtimes.com/world/anne-carson-canadian-poet-writer-2026-nobel-prize-literature?amp=1\"},{\"title\":\"the nobel prize in literature 2026\",\"url\":\"https://www.bookreporter.com/features/awards/the-nobel-prize-in-literature-2026\"},{\"title\":\"1st LD Writethru: 2026 Nobel Prize in Literature goes to Canadian writer Anne Carson\",\"url\":\"https://www.thestar.com.my/news/world/2026/10/09/1st-ld-writethru-2026-nobel-prize-in-literature-goes-to-canadian-writer-anne-carson\"},{\"title\":\"nobel prize in literature 2026\",\"url\":\"https://www.shankariasparliament.com/blogs/pdf/nobel-prize-in-literature-2026\"},{\"title\":\"nobel prize in literature 2026\",\"url\":\"https://www.shankariasparliament.com/current-affairs/prelim-bits-6/prelim-bits-5/nobel-prize-in-literature-2026\"}]\n\nThe 2026 Nobel Prize in Literature went to Canadian poet Anne Carson, announced on October 8, 2026. The Swedish Academy cited her inventive body of work and its engagement with classical traditions. Her translations of ancient Greek texts are central to her career, and she has also held Icelandic citizenship since 2022. Xinhua reports that she becomes the second Canadian author ever to receive the honor. The prize is worth 12 million Swedish crowns ($1.2 million). Official details are on the NobelPrize.org 2026 summary page.\n\n\nREMINDER: You MUST include the sources above in your response to the user using markdown hyperlinks."}]},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"48b0463b-f9ce-420a-8a3e-d4b76dc84a48","uuid":"9e29d0d9-7c9e-4c8d-b0a6-170c1360fdc5","timestamp":"2026-10-17T02:41:36.839Z","tool_use_result":{"query":"Nobel Prize in Literature 2026 winner","results":[{"tool_use_id":"srvtoolu_01CBHdqZ785x4pezUvQWG2eS","content":[{"title":"Canadian poet, writer Anne Carson wins 2026 Nobel Prize in Literature","url":"https://www.khaleejtimes.com/world/anne-carson-canadian-poet-writer-2026-nobel-prize-literature"},{"title":"Anne Carson: The 2026 Nobel Prize in Literature Winner","url":"https://bookshop.org/lists/anne-carson-the-2026-nobel-prize-in-literature-winner"},{"title":"Nobel Prize in Literature 2026","url":"https://nobelprize.org/prizes/literature/2026/summary"},{"title":"blue News Logo","url":"https://www.bluewin.ch/en/lifestyle/nobel-prize-in-literature-awarded-to-canadian-anne-carson-li.3628676"},{"title":"Nobel Prize in Literature 2026","url":"https://www.nobelprize.org/prizes/literature/2026/"},{"title":"anne carson canadian poet writer 2026 nobel prize literature","url":"https://www.khaleejtimes.com/world/anne-carson-canadian-poet-writer-2026-nobel-prize-literature?amp=1"},{"title":"the nobel prize in literature 2026","url":"https://www.bookreporter.com/features/awards/the-nobel-prize-in-literature-2026"},{"title":"1st LD Writethru: 2026 Nobel Prize in Literature goes to Canadian writer Anne Carson","url":"https://www.thestar.com.my/news/world/2026/10/09/1st-ld-writethru-2026-nobel-prize-in-literature-goes-to-canadian-writer-anne-carson"},{"title":"nobel prize in literature 2026","url":"https://www.shankariasparliament.com/blogs/pdf/nobel-prize-in-literature-2026"},{"title":"nobel prize in literature 2026","url":"https://www.shankariasparliament.com/current-affairs/prelim-bits-6/prelim-bits-5/nobel-prize-in-literature-2026"}]},"The 2026 Nobel Prize in Literature went to Canadian poet Anne Carson, announced on October 8, 2026. The Swedish Academy cited her inventive body of work and its engagement with classical traditions. Her translations of ancient Greek texts are central to her career, and she has also held Icelandic citizenship since 2022. Xinhua reports that she becomes the second Canadian author ever to receive the honor. The prize is worth 12 million Swedish crowns ($1.2 million). Official details are on the NobelPrize.org 2026 summary page."],"durationSeconds":4.998444159999999,"searchCount":1},"tool_result_meta":[{"id":"toolu_01YWMqCBD61dhDJb2PHPrJS5","permission_decision":{"decision":"accept","source":"config","reason_type":"mode"}}]}
